# Web3Forms access key — relays the contact form to your inbox.
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com (enter your email, it's mailed to you).
#
# No VITE_ prefix, and that's deliberate: Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed
# variables to client code, so this one can never end up in the bundle. It is
# read by api/contact.js, which runs on the server, and the browser never sees
# it — not in the bundle, not in the Network tab.
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in, then set the same variable in your host's
# environment (Vercel -> Settings -> Environment Variables).
WEB3FORMS_KEY=
